⑩00000196⑿
易考范文十五
⑩00000481⑿
What we can see are two shocking drawings.
⑩00001017⑿
In the first one,
⑩00001137⑿
black clouds of exhaust fume are emitted from a high chimney.
⑩00001542⑿
In the second, a signal tower stands instead of the ugly chimney,
⑩00002089⑿
sending out invisible harmful radiation.
⑩00002373⑿
The problem revealed in the drawings has, indeed,
⑩00002756⑿
aroused nationwide concern.
⑩00002953⑿
Nowadays, some local governments are in hot pursuit of economic development,
⑩00003543⑿
as a result of which people's income has increased.
⑩00003926⑿
At the same time, however,
⑩00004090⑿
their health is being threatened by the worsening environment,
⑩00004495⑿
which is the side effect of blind expansion in economy.
⑩00004834⑿
It has been generally accepted that
⑩00005096⑿
it is unwise to sacrifice people's welfare for short-term interest.
⑩00005556⑿
However, there is no doubt that we cannot put the cart before the horse
⑩00010015⑿
by halting economic progress solely for the sake of our health,
⑩00010420⑿
as development is definitely an irreversible trend.
⑩00010814⑿
As far as I am concerned, firstly,
⑩00011120⑿
it is imperative for governments at all levels
⑩00011383⑿
to put more stress on environmental protection
⑩00011677⑿
so as to ensure the harmonious coexistence of nature and economy.
⑩00012192⑿
Secondly,
⑩00012323⑿
in addition to the strict implementation of laws and regulations concerning environment,
⑩00012859⑿
the government's strengthened awareness of the public well-being
⑩00013209⑿
will contribute to the solution of this issue.
